Scope	
 Enhance the field D_PRODUCT_TYPE and D_RECON_PRODUCT_TYPE for DM_REPO (Repurchase Agreement) in SAS DWH

Business Objective	
To enhance D_PRODUCT_TYPE and D_RECON_PRODUCT_TYPE for DM_REPO

Required Functionality	
To enhance the field D_PRODUCT_TYPE and D_RECON_PRODUCT_TYPE for DM_REPO in SAS DWH, specifically to cater for the FX Repurchase Agreement.
 
Existing criteria remain unchanged.
To lookup value based on mapping file, i.e. D_MM_PROD_TYPE from \\mpnsvfil001\MIS-FD Control Template
 
Additional criteria for enhancement.
When D_CURRENCY_CD equals "MYR" then "RM REPURCHASE AGREEMENTS"
When D_CURRENCY_CD not equals to "MYR" then "FX REPURCHASE AGREEMENT"
 
Please refer to attachment "Sample Result" for expected result after enhancement.




Technical Design

Technical Approach
Enhance D_PRODUCT_TYPE & D_RECON_PRODUCT_TYPE for existing DM_REPOyymmdd (Repurchase Agreement) only 

Affected Program: 
•	DM_REPO
•	
Enhancement (Adopt TRANWRD function): 






D_PRODUCT_TYPE    = put(D_IDENTIFIER,$D_TD_PRODUCT_TYPE.); << Existing
D_RECON_PROD_TYPE = put(D_IDENTIFIER,$D_TD_PRODUCT_TYPE.); << Existing

IF D_IDENTIFIER = 'REPO' AND CURRENCY NE 'MYR' THEN DO;
	D_PRODUCT_TYPE    = TRANWRD(D_PRODUCT_TYPE,'RM','FX');
	D_RECON_PROD_TYPE = TRANWRD(D_RECON_PROD_TYPE,'RM','FX');
END;














